{"id": "EUVD-2026-71004", "enisaUuid": "c078d706-b6b4-33a0-a6a3-b70fd1e689de", "description": "SiYuan before v3.8.2 contains a denial of service vulnerability in the unauthenticated /api/system/uiproc endpoint that accepts and retains attacker-controlled process identifiers without size limits or authentication. Attackers can send repeated requests with unique identifiers to exhaust process memory and degrade service availability.", "datePublished": "2026-09-04T11:29:50", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-10T15:09:54", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan/security/advisories/GHSA-wv96-wmf5-xvj2", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/siyuan-before-3.8.2-denial-of-service-via-unauthenticated-ui-process-registration"], "aliases": ["GHSA-4qv4-f447-c9m2", "CVE-2026-85581"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.58, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "3be5e904-da96-3fc6-8b88-cc5ad9eac162", "product": {"name": "SiYuan", "vendor": {"name": "siyuan-note"}}, "product_version": "0 <3.8.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "5273e071-1caf-3444-bcdb-2abdee50f6ad", "vendor": {"name": "siyuan-note"}}], "isExploited": false}